{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cec.zju.edu.cn/2026/0908/c36131a3200220/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:12.942707+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://www.cec.zju.edu.cn/2026/0908/c36131a3200220/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><h2><br/></h2><p><span><span><span>欢迎我校优秀本科毕业生推荐免试来我院攻读研究生。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>一、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>报名时间及方式</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>请本校同学在</span></span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span><span>中午</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>12:00前登录我校研究生招生服务系统完成报名申请</span></span></span><span><span>。详见“浙江大学关于</span></span><span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年接收外校推荐免试研究生工作安排的通知”</span></span><span><span><span>，</span></span></span><span><span>网址：</span></span></span></span><span><span><a href=\"http://www.grs.zju.edu.cn/yjszs/2026/0805/c28479a3193539/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.grs.zju.edu.cn/yjszs/2026/0805/c28479a3193539/page.htm</a></span></span></p><p><strong><span>必须在截止时间前完成申请，逾期不再受理。</span></strong></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>二、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>填报注意事项</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（一）系统上传材料要求（下列文件放入一个文件夹并压缩为一个文件包上传）</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span><span>身份证：原件扫描件，正反面置于同一页面，仅截图无效</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span><span>个人照片：证件照或生活照均可</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span><span><span><span>本科期间成绩单及排名证明：均须加盖学校</span></span></span><span><span><span>/</span></span></span><span><span><span>学院相关部门公章，排名证明应注明名次和参加排名的总人数</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span><span><span><span>外语水平证明：大学英语六级成绩单等</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span><span><span><span>已发表的论文、获奖证书：扫描件，合计不超过</span></span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span>项。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（二）申请本科直博要求</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span><span>外语要求：英语六级≥</span></span></span><span><span><span>500</span></span></span><span><span><span>分，成绩有效期为五年；或托福≥</span></span></span><span><span><span>90</span></span></span><span><span><span>分，或雅思（学术类）≥</span></span></span><span><span><span>6.5</span></span></span><span><span><span>分，不认可家庭版和拼分成绩，参照证书的有效期。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span><span>须提供至少两名报考学科专业领域内副教授及以上职称专家（或相当专业职称的专家）的书面推荐意见。模板详见附件，</span></span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span>份推荐书于</span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span>月中下旬资格审查时现场提交，可提前准备完毕。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（三）填报备注</span></span></span></p><p><a href=\"http://www.cec.zju.edu.cn/2026/0908/c36131a3200220/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><span><strong>请在备注栏填写推免名额来源，例如“学院（系）”“</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>1+2</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>支教团”“</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>2+2</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>思政辅导员”“其他（具体说明）”。</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>三、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>咨询联系方式</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>咨询邮箱：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>sainanwang@zju.edu.cn</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>咨询电话：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>0571-88981625</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p>    <img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/4c3b492ca5c48cbaed83.gif\"/><a href=\"http://www.cec.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/f6/eb/c813e1fb406daaba07623582dcb3/e36edb95-9dea-4065-8d7d-b584d763320c.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">专家推荐书.docx</a></p></div>","textSha256":"84c32f21a4e30078efc34c239273904b4d509902945a9666171b33e4e51f31bf","textLength":664,"sourceSha256":"6070a36645c41b76bc42e3881bd55b9f5fdf589854fda65bec45512d7762decf","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-f57fc8e8ef7d50c1351c","title":"2026年浙江大学经济学院关于2027年接收本校推荐免试生申请的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:12.942707+00:00","mirroredImages":[{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cec.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/4c3b492ca5c48cbaed83.gif"}]}
